---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Terms of Service - ${siteConfig.name} | User Agreement & Editorial Usage`}
  description="Terms and Conditions governing the access, readership, community comments, and intellectual property use on TG Movies."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 mb-2">
        <span>Binding Legal Agreement</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">
        Last Updated: September 27, 2026 • Effective Immediately
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-6">
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-medium">
        Welcome to <strong>TG Movies</strong>. These Terms of Service ("Terms") constitute a legally binding agreement between you ("User", "Reader", or "You") and TG Movies ("We", "Our", or "Platform"), governed by Chief Editor <strong>Aman Alria</strong>. By accessing or interacting with <a href="https://tgmovies.in" class="text-sky-600 hover:underline">tgmovies.in</a>, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agreed to be governed by these Terms and our companion Privacy Policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        1. Access Eligibility & Site Usage
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        You are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access TG Movies strictly for personal, non-commercial informative and entertainment purposes. You agree not to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
        <li>Deploy automated scripts, bots, spiders, or screen scrapers to harvest editorial text, structured schema data, or film images without express written permission from TG Movies.</li>
        <li>Attempt to interfere with the network integrity, routing, or speed performance of our Cloudflare edge infrastructure through Denial of Service (DoS) attacks or malicious payloads.</li>
        <li>Circumvent or attempt to disable digital rights management, security tokens, or content protection headers configured across our endpoints.</li>
        <li>Impersonate any person, brand, studio entity, or member of the TG Movies masthead in public comment sections or communications.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        2. Intellectual Property & Fair-Use Standards
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        All original editorial prose, critical film reviews, box office analytical breakdowns, custom graphic layouts, and curated guides published on TG Movies represent the intellectual property of TG Movies and Aman Alria, protected under national and international copyright statutes.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Fair Use Doctrine:</strong> Movie posters, promotional stills, production screenshots, and official trailers referenced or displayed on our articles remain the property of their respective production studios, copyright holders, and distributors. TG Movies utilizes these assets strictly under fair use principles for transformative educational commentary, criticism, news reporting, and identification.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Content Syndication & Quotations:</strong> You may quote brief excerpts (up to 75 words) of our reviews provided that you include prominent, direct hyperlinked attribution to the original article URL on <a href="https://tgmovies.in" class="text-sky-600 hover:underline">tgmovies.in</a>. Full-text scraping or syndication without prior contractual licensing is strictly prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        3. Community Comment Guidelines & User Submissions
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        TG Movies provides an interactive discussion and comment platform on our articles, connected directly to our secure Cloudflare D1 database. By posting comments on our site, you agree to uphold our community standards:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
        <li><strong>Constructive Discourse:</strong> Discussions regarding cinema, storytelling, box office performance, and directorial craft must remain civil and respectful. Personal attacks, harassment, defamatory remarks, hate speech, or abuse targeting fellow commenters, artists, or editorial staff will result in immediate removal.</li>
        <li><strong>No Spam or Commercial Links:</strong> Comments containing affiliate links, spam, promotional software downloads, or commercial solicitations are strictly rejected.</li>
        <li><strong>Spoiler Warnings:</strong> Major cinematic plot twists, post-credits revelations, and narrative surprises must be preceded by an explicit "SPOILER ALERT" warning to respect fellow readers.</li>
        <li><strong>Content License:</strong> By posting a comment, you grant TG Movies a perpetual, irrevocable, royalty-free license to display, archive, or moderate your comment on our platform.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        4. External Hyperlinks & Third-Party Platforms
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Our articles regularly contain contextual outbound links to external third-party resources, including authoritative industry portals (such as Sacnilk, Bollywood Hungama, Box Office Mojo, IMDb), official studio portals, and streaming networks (Netflix, Prime Video, Disney+ Hotstar). While we link only to trusted, relevant resources, TG Movies does not control and is not liable for the content, privacy policies, or commercial practices of external domains.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        5. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        TG Movies is provided strictly on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis without representations or warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. While we take every reasonable measure to ensure factual veracity, theatrical release schedules and box office numbers remain subject to dynamic industry changes.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Under no circumstances shall TG Movies, its founder Aman Alria, or its contributors be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your access to or inability to use this website, or any reliance placed upon published film commentary.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        6. Modifications to Terms & Contact Information
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        We reserve the right to revise or update these Terms of Service at any time without prior individual notice. All updates take effect immediately upon being posted on this page. If you have questions regarding these Terms or wish to request syndication rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:amanalha07@gmail.com" class="text-sky-600 hover:underline">amanalha07@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
